        "created_at": "2018-04-25T17:52:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There's also the possibility of roleplay toys. Things like Legacy and Wraith capes, plastic Bunker and AZ masks and Tachyon goggles, watches with the FV logo on them that have little flashlights that project pictures of each hero, wrist launchers that fire plastic 'Razor Ordinance' knives and Flak Cannons with firing sounds...</p><p>Not to mention the flood of Halloween costumes.</p>",
