        "created_at": "2018-05-02T10:25:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thinking about it, I’d probably be super into some of those micro-playset toys like Mighty Max or Polly Pocket - an environment like Freedom Tower or the Tomb of Anubis, each with at least a hero, a villain, and a mook, with some cool little set pieces, I think that would be really amazing.</p>",
