        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-05-02T12:48:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Flint Paper\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Flint Paper:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hmmmm. I am actually in the early stages of my biggest custom project ever: action figures of every single hero and villain in the Multiverse. I have nearly all the figures that I need for almost everyone except the Citizens of the Sun (Dawn's all set), Biomancer's Fleshchildrene, the FILTER crew, and the gladiators (Kaargara, similarly, is all set). Missing some of the minor villains, too, but I'll get there. But otherwise, every hero, every villain and most of the minor villains, several of the environment targets, accessories, and variants have their bases figures selected and isolated. It's going to be a LOT of work but I'm pretty chuffed about it.I am in the process of setting up my workplace at my new apartment and organizing so that I can get started in earnest, maybe in the near future I can at least put up some in-progress photos. Once I have time to set up the photo studio on the dining room table, that is.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>We should talk… Seriously. Send me an email. <a href=\"mailto:craig@greaterthangames.com\">craig@greaterthangames.com</a>. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Edit: To be clear, this isn't scary cease and desist kind of stuff. This is \"my major hobby is taking photos of action figures\" stuff, and I happen to have a particular interest in photographing Sentinel Comics stuff if it's ever around.</p>",
